                        <p>
                            Artisans register verified trade profiles showcasing certifications, past work, and coverage areas. Clients can browse categories, filter by local radius, submit booking inquiries, and leave verified ratings.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="detail-section">
                        <h2 class="detail-section-title"><i data-lucide="check-circle" class="lucide-icon-sm"></i> Main Features</h2>
                        <ul class="detail-list">
                            <li>Directory search with trade category and location filters</li>
                            <li>Artisan portfolio and verification badge displays</li>
                            <li>Direct client inquiry and quote request form</li>
                            <li>Review and feedback submission mechanism</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="detail-section">
                        <h2 class="detail-section-title"><i data-lucide="user" class="lucide-icon-sm"></i> My Contribution</h2>
                        <p>
                            Developed ASP.NET Core views and models, created search and filtering algorithms, implemented artisan registration workflows, and optimized mobile-friendly UI views.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <div class="detail-sidebar">
                        <div class="detail-meta-card">
                            <h5>Project Status</h5>
                            <span class="project-status completed">✔ Completed</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="detail-meta-card">
                            <h5>Technologies</h5>
                            <div class="technology-tags mt-2">
