            <div class="row g-5">
                <div class="col-lg-8">
                    <div class="detail-section">
                        <h2 class="detail-section-title"><i data-lucide="info" class="lucide-icon-sm"></i> Project Overview</h2>
                        <p>
                            A corporate website developed for Thrive Development Group to establish their online presence, describe training and consulting services, and manage inquiry leads.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="detail-section">
                        <h2 class="detail-section-title"><i data-lucide="alert-circle" class="lucide-icon-sm"></i> Problem Addressed</h2>
                        <p>
