                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="detail-section">
                        <h2 class="detail-section-title"><i data-lucide="cpu" class="lucide-icon-sm"></i> How the System Works</h2>
                        <p>
                            Constructed using modular Razor components and a clean ASP.NET Core backend. Integrates contact dispatch logic to direct prospective client submissions to administration teams.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="detail-section">
                        <h2 class="detail-section-title"><i data-lucide="check-circle" class="lucide-icon-sm"></i> Main Features</h2>
                        <ul class="detail-list">
                            <li>Responsive corporate layouts optimized for all device sizes</li>
                            <li>Interactive services showcase with program outlines</li>
                            <li>Integrated contact and consultation inquiry pipeline</li>
                            <li>Accessible and performant markup</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="detail-section">
                        <h2 class="detail-section-title"><i data-lucide="user" class="lucide-icon-sm"></i> My Contribution</h2>
                        <p>
                            Structured the page layout, implemented the MVC architecture, styled the components, and deployed the application.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <div class="detail-sidebar">
                        <div class="detail-meta-card">
                            <h5>Project Status</h5>
                            <span class="project-status completed">✔ Completed</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="detail-meta-card">
                            <h5>Technologies</h5>
                            <div class="technology-tags mt-2">
                                <span class="technology-tag">ASP.NET Core</span>
                                <span class="technology-tag">C#</span>
                                <span class="technology-tag">Bootstrap</span>
                                <span class="technology-tag">CSS3</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="detail-meta-card">
                            <h5>Category</h5>
                            <p>Corporate Web Portal</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        }
        else if (projectId == "imifuno")
        {
            <div class="project-detail-header mb-5">
                <span class="project-status completed mb-3 d-inline-block">✔ Completed</span>
                <h1 class="project-detail-title">Imifuno</h1>
                <div class="tech-stack mt-3">
                    <span>Python</span>
                    <span>Flask</span>
                    <span>SQL</span>
                    <span>Bootstrap</span>
                    <span>JavaScript</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row g-5">
                <div class="col-lg-8">
                    <div class="detail-section">
                        <h2 class="detail-section-title"><i data-lucide="info" class="lucide-icon-sm"></i> Project Overview</h2>
                        <p>
                            Imifuno is an agricultural marketplace connecting small-scale vegetable and crop farmers with commercial buyers, grocery stores, and local distributors.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="detail-section">
                        <h2 class="detail-section-title"><i data-lucide="alert-circle" class="lucide-icon-sm"></i> Problem Addressed</h2>
                        <p>
                            Smallholder farmers often face barriers accessing formal markets, leading to crop waste and low price realization due to dependence on intermediaries.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="detail-section">
                        <h2 class="detail-section-title"><i data-lucide="cpu" class="lucide-icon-sm"></i> How the System Works</h2>
                        <p>
                            The application uses Python and Flask with an SQL database. Farmers can list upcoming crop harvests with estimated dates and volumes, while commercial buyers place reserve orders directly.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="detail-section">
                        <h2 class="detail-section-title"><i data-lucide="check-circle" class="lucide-icon-sm"></i> Main Features</h2>
                        <ul class="detail-list">
                            <li>Produce inventory and harvest availability listings</li>
                            <li>Direct buyer-to-farmer order requests</li>
                            <li>Produce category filtering and price indicators</li>
                            <li>Mobile-responsive lightweight interface</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="detail-section">
                        <h2 class="detail-section-title"><i data-lucide="user" class="lucide-icon-sm"></i> My Contribution</h2>
                        <p>
                            Designed the relational database, developed the Flask application endpoints, built user authentication, and implemented the catalog interface.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <div class="detail-sidebar">
                        <div class="detail-meta-card">
                            <h5>Project Status</h5>
                            <span class="project-status completed">✔ Completed</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="detail-meta-card">
                            <h5>Technologies</h5>
