                    <div class="detail-section">
                        <h2 class="detail-section-title"><i data-lucide="alert-circle" class="lucide-icon-sm"></i> Problem Addressed</h2>
                        <p>
                            Paper-based patient intake and disparate schedule records lead to administrative bottlenecks, record loss, and scheduling conflicts in healthcare facilities.
