                        <p>
                            Built using C# and .NET with SQL Server database persistence. Features role access controls for receptionist intake, nursing ward tracking, doctor consultation logs, and pharmacy/billing checkout.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="detail-section">
                        <h2 class="detail-section-title"><i data-lucide="check-circle" class="lucide-icon-sm"></i> Main Features</h2>
                        <ul class="detail-list">
                            <li>Patient record intake, history lookup, and admission tracking</li>
